  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DUF GYP (2019-ongoing) - Danish Youth Council (DUF) Global Youth Programme (GYP) 2019-ongoing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose is to support development activities under The Global Youth Programme of The Danish Youth Council (DUF) where Danish civil society organizations work to strengthen civil society organizations in developing countries. DUF focuses on supporting youth and youth-led organisations in the Global South so that they can influence and contribute to sustainable development.

The Danish Youth Council (DUF) is an umbrella organisation founded in 1940 representing 80 children and youth organisations with more than 600.000 Danish children and youth as members and 100.000 young volunteers. DUF represents a diverse segment of young women and men nationwide such as scouts, political youth organisations, cultural and humanitarian organisations and student organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
